    <string name="onboarding_keys_body">Without a status-provider key, you can save flights, use themes, and see bundled airline info. Maps, airport details, weather, and live positions need route or aircraft details that may be unavailable. Configured status providers receive flight identifiers, dates, and credentials as needed.</string>

